## Map tiles

The parent app renders OpenStreetMap raster tiles directly from
`tile.openstreetmap.org` with an identifying User-Agent and no prefetching:

- Map data © OpenStreetMap contributors, ODbL 1.0.
- Tile usage is subject to the OSM Foundation Tile Usage Policy. For heavier or
  commercial use, switch `OsmMap.kt` to a self-hosted or paid tile provider.

## Fonts

No custom font files are bundled. Malayalam and Latin text use the device's
system fonts, which keeps the APK small and avoids licensing issues.
